        "afterDialogs": [
          {
            "type": "PortraitAndText",
            "textCaption": "Correct! We know from studying their @crest crest that <color=orange>Baby Joe</color>'s call would have been much higher in pitch than an adult <i>Parasaurolophus</i>.",
